  "description": "Translations for any .NET 10+ app, written in C# and checked at compile time: a class per language, inline texts, or an attribute on a type or its members. A missing translation, or one that never uses a value the original shows, is a build error. No resource files, no dependencies, safe to trim and to publish with Native AOT. In preview, so the API can still change between versions.",
